OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy at first with a few showers,
OL,7,Fthese becoming lighter and more
OL,8,Fisolated through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight, allowing a few more clear
OL,10,Fspells to develop.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FThe odd light shower around
OL,13,FNorth Argyll and the Isles at first.
OL,14,FOtherwise dry with sunny spells by
OL,15,Fday. Freshening winds with cloud and
OL,16,Fpatchy rain late in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
