OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,6,FMonday with patchy rain. Early rain
OL,7,Fclearing on Tuesday then sunshine and
OL,8,Fshowers, windy at times. Cloudy and
OL,9,Fwindy Wednesday with rain later.
